<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-20T03:38:28.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:38:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine is under intensified attack as Russia launched a mass missile strike on Kyiv, causing a fire and killing one person, while Russian strikes also damaged Dutch and Austrian embassies. Kyiv responded by striking the key bridge to Crimea for the third time this week, increasing pressure on the occupied peninsula. In parallel, Trump, Xi and Putin met in Shenzhen, pledging to increase oil supply and discussing Ukraine, and Putin invited European leaders to Moscow for talks on ending the war. Macron urged Ukraine's allies to reopen the NATO membership question, and Kushner said Russia is comfortable with NATO-like security guarantees for Ukraine. Battle-related deaths totaled 75,767 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c623j4ln97x7o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/russian-strikes-on-kyiv-kill-one-damage-dutch-and-austrian-embassies&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckzd9nln5e6go?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20261119-macron-urges-ukraine-allies-reopen-question-nato-membership&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/xi-jinping-donald-trump-and-vladimir-putin-have-held-trilateral-talks-―-but-what-did-they-achieve/a-79996668?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/russia-china-united-states-oil-joint-statement.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/wadephul-coalition-of-the-willing-talks-in-berlin-send-strong-signal-to-moscow/a-79990664?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;